# Five keyed rows. Rows 2 and 3 mentor id 11, which the second statement despawns: the same
# spelling is a live link before the barrier and a dead one after it.
n 5
unique id nat 7 11 13 17 19
rel id mentor -1 7 11 11 13
col cursed bool 0 1 0 0 0
col nord bool 1 1 1 1 1
col dead bool 0 0 1 0 0
col gold num 0 0 0 0 0
